      "content": "thanks for letting me know. i was a bit worried about that. but my doctor actually said vitamins were fine, maybe he just forgot i was on the warfarin? i don't want to keep bothering him every time i add a supplement. if i just take a slightly smaller dose of the vitamin K, or maybe just take it every other day, do you think that would keep my levels stable enough so it doesn't mess with my blood thinner too much?",
