      "content": "i get that it's tricky, but i really hate going back to the office for every little thing. it's such a hassle. if i just take the vitamin K at a different time of day, like late at night right before bed while my warfarin is wearing off, would that help? or maybe i could just take a much lower dose, like 50mcg instead of the full amount? i feel like i can manage it if i'm just careful with the timing.",
